        <p class="hub-desc">The first three tools assume returns arrive in trend order. They do not. A crash early in retirement sells far more bitcoin to cover the same bill, and that stack does not come back when price does. This page drops a timed bear market into your plan and varies its depth, its timing and how it recovers.</p>
